  "description": "*\"You will regret this.\"* \n\nAspiring drama writer, Gam-Sa, breaks up with her long-term boyfriend, Ji-Ho, thinking he's been romantically involved with Eun-Gyeong. Despite Ji-Ho's ominous warning, Gam-Sa tries to carry on with her normal life...Until she hears Ji-Ho and Eun-Gyeong have been found dead together in a motel. \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
